<title>UK: London gold fixes up on Australian sales rumour.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes up on Australian sales rumour.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $332.55 vs $332.30 AM. Swung on rumour of Australian central bank sale of 167 tonnes - since confirmed.</p>
<p>Off intraday low on short covering.</p>
<p>SILVER - Barely changed at $4.64/$4.66, down a cent.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Very quiet at unchanged $423.00/$426.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also quiet at unchanged $190.00/$193.00</p>
</text>
